						"value": "OUTLETS\n\n• BPM\nOutputs the BPM as a float.\n\n•  Beat Count\nOutputs the beat count as a flot.\n\n• Numerator\nOutputs the top number of the time signature as a float.\n\n• Denominator\nOutputs the bottom number of the time signature as a float.\n\n"
